<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Special Offer for UAE Sender ID Registration</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #333333;
            text-align: center;
        }
        p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .highlight {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff6600;
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: #ff6600;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #e65c00;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .document-list {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .document-list ol {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .requirements {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .sample-links {
            background-color: #fff3e6;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .video-section {
            background-color: #e6f3ff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .video-btn {
            background-color: #ff0000;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .video-btn:hover {
            background-color: #cc0000;
        }
        .sample-links a {
            color: #ff6600;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .sample-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .small-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666666;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Limited Offer: Free UAE Sender ID Registration</h1>
        
        <p>Dear <%= @name %>,</p>
        
        <p>We have exciting news for you! As a valued merchant, you now have the opportunity to send SMS messages using your own brand name. We're thrilled to announce a special offer exclusively for our esteemed clients.</p>
        
        <p>We have became the official local partner with SMS country and now work directly with UAE government.</p>
        
        <b><p>For a limited time, we're offering free UAE Sender ID registration for the first <b>50 applications</b> who apply. Don't miss this chance to enhance your brand visibility and customer engagement!</p></b>
        
            <div class="video-section">
            <p><strong>Watch Our Step-by-Step Guide</strong></p>
            <p>Learn how to properly register your Sender ID by watching our detailed tutorial video.</p>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IWQFIdYavsI" target="_blank" class="video-btn">
                Watch Tutorial Video
            </a>
        </div>

        <p>To take advantage of this offer, please provide the following documents:</p>
        
        <div class="document-list">
            <ol>
                <li>NOC on your company letterhead with signature and stamp</li>
                <li>Completed DU form (scanned copy)</li>
                <li>Your company's trade license</li>
                <li>Authorized person's Emirates ID and passport (scanned copies)</li>
                <li>Establishment card (scanned copy)</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="requirements">
            <p><strong>Important NOC Requirements:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Must be on company letterhead with authorized signatory's signature and stamp</li>
                <li>Must include company's original SEAL over the signature</li>
                <li>Digital signatures are not accepted</li>
                <li>Sender ID can be maximum 11 characters (special characters & space allowed)</li>
                <li>If requesting both promotional and transactional messaging, list the sender ID twice with respective types</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="sample-links">
            <p><strong>Download Sample Documents:</strong></p>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-b6Pa9bu3wL_qmxRUuwZ9u3fD92qZJoZ/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=114105612098093464534&rtpof=true&sd=true" target="_blank">➤ Sample NOC Template</a>
            <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/15_W63D0DQOotXD-KY0QuMbXLj9ogxCns/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank">➤ Sample DU Form</a>
        </div>

    
        
        <p>To proceed, simply reply to this email with the required documents attached. Our team will guide you through the process and ensure a smooth registration experience.</p>
        
        <p style="text-align: center;">
            Have questions or need assistance? We're here to help!<br>
            <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" target="_blank" class="btn">Chat with us now</a>
        </p>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p class="small-text">Thank you for choosing COD King. We look forward to helping you elevate your SMS communications.</p>
            <p class="small-text">Best regards,</p>
            <p class="small-text">The COD King Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>